[[File:EoCMenuButton.png|thumb]]
'''Empire of Cats''' (日本編, ''Nihon-hen'', '''Japan Arc'''), commonly shortened to EoC, is the first saga in [[The Battle Cats]]/[[Nyanko Daisensou]] and is unlocked from the beginning. This mode contains 3 chapters, with 48 stages in each. Collecting all [[Treasure]]s available in each stage is the main goal in this mode. Chapter 1 has been available since [[Ganso!! Nyanko Daisensou]], while Chapters 2 and 3 were introduced in the re-release, [[Nyanko Daisensou]].

[[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] added [[Zombie Outbreaks]] to Chapter 1, [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]] brought them to Chapter 2, and [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]] brought them to Chapter 3.

==Story==
The Empire of Cats intro plays when opening the game for the first time. In most versions of The Battle Cats, Empire of Cats focuses on the [[Cat Units|Cats]] taking over Earth and the [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]], but in the Japanese Version, they only take over the 47 prefectures of Japan and [[wikipedia:Iriomote Island|Iriomote Island]]. As a result, the Japanese Version has different names, [[Treasure]]s, [[Backgrounds|backgrounds]] and [[Enemy Bases|enemy bases]] for most stages, though the stages themselves play out the same in all versions. This also applies to [[The Aku Realms]].

In the opening, Empire of Cats is stated to begin on New Year's Eve of whatever year the device's clock is set to. For example, if the current year is {{CURRENTYEAR}}, Empire of Cats starts on the last day of {{CURRENTYEAR}}.

