==Chapter 1: The Battle Cats Rising==
[[File:EoC1MenuButton.png|thumb]]
(にゃんこ軍団日本侵略！！ ''Nyanko Gundan Nihon Shinryaku!!'', '''Cat Army Invading Japan!!''')
*Units cost 33.3% less than they normally would in this chapter (example: [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] costs 50¢ instead of 75¢).
*All enemies in this chapter have a strength magnification of 100%.
*The [[Bean Cats (Special Cat)|Bean Cats]] are unlocked after completing [[Greece (Empire of Cats)|Greece/Shiga]].
*The final boss of this chapter is [[The Face]], with a wave of regular peons.
*Players receive [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]] and 50 [[Cat Food]] upon completion.
*Completing this chapter also unlocks [[Into the Future]], [[Legend Stages]], [[Ototo Corps]], [[Cat Combo]]s, the Switch Class button and two more Battle Formations.
*Obtaining all Superior [[Treasure]]s in this chapter awards 1,000,000 XP.

==Chapter 2: The Emperor of Darkness==
[[File:EoC2MenuButton.png|thumb]]
(降臨！！悪の帝王ニャンダム ''Kōrin!! Aku no Teiō Nyandamu'', '''Advent!! Evil Emperor Nyandam''')
*Units have their usual cost in this chapter, or 50% more than in Chapter 1.
*All enemies in this chapter have a strength magnification of 150%.
*The final boss of this chapter is [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]], with a stronger wave of peons.
*Players receive [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] and 50 Cat Food upon completion.
*Completing this chapter also increases the level cap to 20 and unlocks the [[Cat Filter]] and All Cats buttons in the Upgrade and Equip menus.
*Obtaining all Superior Treasures in this chapter awards 1,000,000 XP.

==Chapter 3: Revival of Bahamut-Cat==
[[File:EoC3MenuButton.png|thumb|]]
(蘇る、超古代兵器ネコムート！！ ''Yomigaeru, Kodai Heiki Nekomūto!!'', '''Reviving, Super Ancient Weapon Cathamut!!''')
*Units cost 33.3% more than usual in this chapter, or twice as much as in Chapter 1 (example: [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] costs 100¢ instead of 75¢).
*All enemies in this chapter have a strength magnification of 400%.
*The final boss of this chapter is [[Teacher Bun Bun]], with non-stop waves of even stronger peons.
*Players unlock [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and 100 Cat Food upon completion.
*Completing this chapter also unlocks [[Catfruit]] and most of the [[:Category:Catfruit Stages|Catfruit Stages]].
*Obtaining all Superior Treasures in this chapter awards 1,000,000 XP.
*After beating the chapter, [[Hidden Forest of Gapra]] gets unlocked.

