==Trivia==
*Most of the [[Enemy Bases|enemy bases]] in the English version of Empire of Cats were taken directly from [[Kumanchu Royale]].
*Antarctica (南極 ''Nankyoku'') is the only main Kumanchu Royale stage that does not appear in the English version of Empire of Cats.
*From [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]] onward, playing on December 31st shows an [https://youtu.be/SkSqWL-u7Vg alternate version] of the game's intro in which [[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|True Superfeline]] steadily approaches the player. At the end of the intro, the screen turns red, alluding to the line, "[current year], New Year's Eve. The Japanese archipelago is stained with blood," ([current year]年、大晦日。日本列島が血に染まる) from the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese Version]] of the Empire of Cats intro.
*[[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Master of Mind Catcrates]]' Japanese description directly references the line, "'Nyanko' and 'Chanko' sound similar," (にゃんこ」と「ちゃんこ」は響きが似ている) from the Japanese Version's intro.
*"A government of the Cats, by the Cats, for the Cats is the new world!" is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Gettysburg Address|Gettysburg Address]], in which Abraham Lincoln famously stated that "government of the people, by the people, for the people, shall not perish from the earth."
*There are only three enemy types in Empire of Cats: [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]], [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] and [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]].
*In the Taiwanese Version, stages 1 and 2 are Taiwan and Hong Kong instead of [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Korea]] and [[Mongolia (Empire of Cats)|Mongolia]], which appear later in place of [[Philippines (Empire of Cats)|Philippines]] and [[Cambodia (Empire of Cats)|Cambodia]] respectively. Due to the additions of Taiwan and Hong Kong, Philippines and Cambodia do not appear as playable stages in the Taiwanese Version. The only differences are the stage names, Treasure names and enemy bases.
*Prior to [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]], the Empire of Cats opening would play every time the player opened the game, regardless of which area they last visited. As of 13.6, it now only plays if the last area visited was Empire of Cats or an area without an opening (e.g., [[Catclaw Dojo]]).

